id: pm-vcs-renewal-heap-26
title: Investigate Node 26 heap exhaustion in the renewal closure coverage test
description: "The Node 26 coverage shard for PR #205 at 7dd2d671155e253c5aa3612f7f59b0379f77ce06 failed in the renewal closure discards leaf bytes test. The 32 MiB child process hit its JavaScript heap limit on Node 26.13.1. The PR diff consists of tracker records, changelog and the generated self-host bundle. An isolated instrumented run on main 84b97b6 with Node 26.13.0 passed 1/1. Compare the exact coverage shard and runtime with instrumented and uninstrumented controls before changing the fixture or its memory contract. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/actions/runs/45152947426/job/137618937076."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: ci,coverage,memory
created_at: "2026-11-23T10:24:00.970Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-23T16:35:10.003Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T10:25:24.129Z",codex-agent,The linked focused check also passed on the local Node 26.13.0 instrumented run. The CI 26.13.1 shard failure remains unresolved.
  "2026-11-23T16:17:12.398Z",codex-agent,"The hosted Node 26.13.1 c8 shard 2 exhausted the 32 MiB child. The local covered control completes on the same runtime. A forced-GC startup comparison importing the same modules measured 31.4 MB of JavaScript heap with V8 coverage enabled and 24.8 MB without it, before traversing the repository. Isolate only the cold memory and syscall probe from coverage instrumentation; keep the surrounding test and parent-process closure checks instrumented."
  "2026-11-23T16:29:22.183Z",codex-agent,"On Node 26.13.1 the fixed covered test runner passes its original 32 MiB child budget and verifies 72 reachable objects read exactly once. In a disposable 30 MiB diagnostic control, reverting only the child coverage override reproduced V8 heap exhaustion. The same control passed with the override restored. The checked-in 32 MiB cap and traversal assertions stay intact."
  "2026-11-23T16:35:09.007Z",codex-agent,"The Node 26.13.1 linked renewal test passed with parent V8 coverage enabled. The isolated startup comparison and behavioral revert pin the failure to instrumenting the 32 MiB memory probe. The final changelog, identity and package privacy gates run before push."
